; Zone: lan
; Type: Forward / Master
; Managed via: Synology DNS Server UI (http://10.0.1.15:5010)
; Serial: 2026052201
;
; Replaces the originally planned `local` zone.
; RFC 6762 reserves `.local` for mDNS/Bonjour/Avahi — overriding it with
; unicast DNS causes Apple device and Avahi discovery conflicts.
; `.lan` has no such reservation and is safe for private unicast use.

$TTL 300
$ORIGIN lan.

@   IN  SOA  otsorundscore.lan. admin.lan. (
              2026052201
              3600
              900
              604800
              300 )

@               IN  NS   otsorundscore.lan.

otsorundscore   IN  A    10.0.1.15
misfitsds       IN  A    10.0.1.24
